      "artist": "Ladeburg LIVE",
      "description": "The Bauhaus Monument Federal School Bernau was founded by the Conference of Ministers of Education on the 1st February 2016 nominated for inclusion in the UNESCO World Heritage List for Decision in 2017.",
      "dateCreated": "2016-02-12 14:37:02",
